<Slide notes={`打开 SKILL.md，会看到两段完全不同的东西。

最上面用三条短横线夹住的那一小段叫 front matter，是元数据。里面只有两行：name 和 description。name 是短名称，description 一句话说清这个 Skill 做什么。它的作用不是给模型执行，而是帮宿主判断这一次要不要用它。名字起得含糊、描述写得空泛，宿主就选不中它。

三条短横线以下才是操作说明，这才是真正要执行的部分：输入是什么、操作分几步、什么时候该停下来。

本章放出来的是教学缩略版，句子比全文短。真正练习的时候，以配套目录里的文件全文为准，不要拿缩略版当规范。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.8.1　Skill 的几个组成部分</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>元数据在前，操作说明在后</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 40 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>两段各管一件事</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#26816B' }} />

            <Box style={{ width: 420, height: 76, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>front matter　元数据</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>name 与 description，帮宿主发现并选中方法</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 22, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text></Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 420, height: 76, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>Markdown 正文　操作说明</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>输入、操作与停止条件，这一步才真的执行</Text>
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>描述要写明任务与触发条件；正文要引用实际文件并说明路径基准。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 692, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 692, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>---</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#276FBF', fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>name: open-day-planner</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#20344B', fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>description: 根据房间、活动请求和预约材料编写开放日方案，并运行独立校验。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>---</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 692, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 46, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>输入</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>读 brief、房间表、规则、活动请求和预约材料；先确认日期、时区与来源。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 46, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>操作</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>整理约束 → 使用查询工具 → 生成候选 → 运行校验 → 按错误修正（最多三轮）→ 输出。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 46, background: '#26816B' }} />
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>停止</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>规则冲突、输入缺失或校验仍失败时，保留结果并说明阻塞原因。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.8 Skill：把一套方法做成可以重复使用的材料包</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>06 / 27</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
